The undersigned is directed to say that w.e.f. the afternoon of the 8th June, 1980:-

(i) Shri V.C. Shukla assumed the office of the Minister of Civil Supplies;

(ii) Shri N.D. Tewari assumed the office of the Minister of Planning;

(iii) Shri Kedar Pande assumed the office of the Minister of Irrigation;

(iv) Shri Dalbir Singh assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Petroleum & Chemicals;

(v) Shri T. Anjiah assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Labour;

(vi) Shri Buta Singh assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Shipping & Transport;

(vii) Shri Chandul Chandrakar assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Tourism & Civil Aviation;

(viii)Shri Vikram Mahajan assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Energy;

(ix) Smt. Ram Dulari Sinha assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Information & Broadcasting;

(x) Shri Mallikarjun assumed the office of the Deputy Minister in the Ministry of Railways;

(xi) Shri P. Venkata Reddy assumed the office of the Deputy Minister in the Ministry of Industry;

(xii) Shri Mohammad Usman Arif assumed the office of the Deputy Minister in the Ministry of Works & Housing;

(xiii)Shri Maganbhai Barot assumed the office of the Deputy Minister in the Ministry of Finance;

(xiv)Shri Vijay N. Patil assumed the office of the Deputy Minister in the Departments of Science & Technology and Space; and

